## {{ ansible_managed }}
## SEC-F-006: security-relevant admin commands run by a logged-in user (auid set), any outcome.
## Key audit-wazuh-c is in Wazuh's audit-keys list as "command", so the manager's audit rule alerts on it.
{% for cmd in agent_sec_f_006_installed %}
-a always,exit -F path={{ cmd }} -F perm=x -F auid>=1000 -F auid!=unset -k audit-wazuh-c
{% endfor %}
